# Paper : FourthAgePapers/BoundaryLever/   (00_vision 01_predictions 02_data 03_results)
# Engine: ValaQuenta/modules/angular_rank/ (the 16D oscilloscope, 12 equations)
# Wiki  : Ainulindale/wiki/87_the_boundary_lever.md
